    {
      "id": "I5DtPvdrxdXchjqStaNl1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1365.8147488456693,
      "y": -1225.8054957237744,
      "width": 768.9395141601562,
      "height": 1200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "5l5UAqKGZ5Ng_il9yaK9i",
      "index": "a6V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1207212204,
      "version": 1241,
      "versionNonce": 1325006484,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786010894309,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Band\n\nRun by PnC (parents and citizens committee)\n\nStudents\n    - family contact (relationship, search)\n    - status/lifecycle (interested, active, withdraw, archived)\n    - each active student belongs to 1 group (e.g. Training band, Concert band)\n\nCommunication\n    - group email all families / all families in one group\n\nEvent\n    - e.g. band workshop\n    - runbook for organizing events\n    - email comms\n    - forms\n    - calendar + upcoming events list\n\n\n\n\n\nRehearsals\n    - weekly repeated pattern \n    - only happens during school terms\n    - parent helper roster\n        - auto generate roster\n        - swap / request to swap\n\n\n\nTutor list\n\nInstrument hiring\n    - maintain a list of instrument\n    - instrument has fields\n        - name/type \n        - current holder\n        - service history\n\n\nFinance\n    - charge band fee to families\n    - invoice\n    \n\nOnboarding",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Band\n\nRun by PnC (parents and citizens committee)\n\nStudents\n    - family contact (relationship, search)\n    - status/lifecycle (interested, active, withdraw, archived)\n    - each active student belongs to 1 group (e.g. Training band, Concert band)\n\nCommunication\n    - group email all families / all families in one group\n\nEvent\n    - e.g. band workshop\n    - runbook for organizing events\n    - email comms\n    - forms\n    - calendar + upcoming events list\n\n\n\n\n\nRehearsals\n    - weekly repeated pattern \n    - only happens during school terms\n    - parent helper roster\n        - auto generate roster\n        - swap / request to swap\n\n\n\nTutor list\n\nInstrument hiring\n    - maintain a list of instrument\n    - instrument has fields\n        - name/type \n        - current holder\n        - service history\n\n\nFinance\n    - charge band fee to families\n    - invoice\n    \n\nOnboarding",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
